eventPayload.description:
Represents the payload of the either OGS_UPDATES or CASE_RESOLUTION associated with the notification.

The OGS_UPDATES event payload will contain groupId and ogs updates for the case. 
example : 

```
{
"groupId": "5v0f8asysc1p1jjg2k1zki680",
"watchlist": {
             "numberOfNewResults": 51,
             "numberOfUpdatedResults": 0
            }
}
```

The CASE_RESOLUTION event payload will contain the groupId and the caseResolution details.
